  "`GET /topk?k=10&window=1h&region=IN`",
  "Per-minute partial counts per item; heaps of top-K per window stored in Redis/DB.",
  {"rows": [["x:View/click events"], ["q:Kafka (partitioned by item)"], ["Stream workers: per-partition counts + Count-Min"], ["Merger: global top-K per window"], ["c:Top-K store (Redis)", "Batch job (exact daily)"], ["API"]],
   "edges": [["View/click events", "Kafka (partitioned by item)"], ["Kafka (partitioned by item)", "Stream workers: per-partition counts + Count-Min"], ["Stream workers: per-partition counts + Count-Min", "Merger: global top-K per window", "local top-K"], ["Merger: global top-K per window", "Top-K store (Redis)"], ["Batch job (exact daily)", "Top-K store (Redis)"], ["API", "Top-K store (Redis)"]]},
  ["Partition by item ID so each item's count lives on one worker; each worker keeps counts for the window and its local top-K (heap).",
   "A merger combines local top-Ks into the global top-K every minute; for 1-hour windows, keep 60 per-minute buckets and slide."],
